       Arnoux, 29-Jul-2023.) $)
    df-fldext $a |- /FldExt = { <. e , f >. | ( ( e e. Field /\ f e. Field )
      /\ ( f = ( e |`s ( Base ` f ) ) /\ ( Base ` f ) e. ( SubRing ` e ) ) ) }
      $.

    $( Definition of the field extension degree operation.  (Contributed by
       Thierry Arnoux, 29-Jul-2023.) $)
    df-extdg $a |- [:] = ( e e. _V , f e. ( /FldExt " { e } )
      |-> ( dim ` ( ( subringAlg ` e ) ` ( Base ` f ) ) ) ) $.

    $( Definition of the finite field extension relation.  (Contributed by
       Thierry Arnoux, 29-Jul-2023.) $)
