      -> ( ( J |`t A ) e. Conn <->
      A. x e. A A. y e. A A. r e. B ( ( x .<_ r /\ r .<_ y ) -> r e. A ) ) ) @=
      ? @.
$)
    $( Connectedness in the order topology of a complete uniform totally
       ordered space.  (Contributed by Thierry Arnoux, 15-Sep-2018.) $)
    ordtconn $p |- T. $=
      ( tru ) H $.
  $}


